badge and source","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"wangyixuan818":[{"date":"2026-09-28T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"7804caf099c0efe3a4c6b0fda6b3b3100c0f469c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AboutUs description","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":4,"deletions":41}}},{"hash":"f5608b98b6d75b42771a1be8ead2593bb5ae2b43","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into 17-add-about-us","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-09-29T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"3aa23b50d6aebc485fe2e5ab6453daaaa7155120","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update site-wide project settings","messageBody":"Replace the remaining AB3 metadata and repository link so the\ngenerated documentation identifies RecruiterBuddy and directs users to\nthe team repository.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"84e1ed4ba943bf5640a91cd30cd6514d3342ae9b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update RecruiterBuddy NFRs and glossary","messageBody":"Document portability, reliability, and data requirements for the\nrecruitment workflow. Define the terms used by those requirements and\nreplace the outdated AddressBook entries.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":13,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"a7ced6322f2d2d99cd90e53b4737e106ebf13ceb","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Refine NFRs and recruitment glossary","messageBody":"The requirements focus on recruitment records, leaving configuration\nand status history without explicit persistence guarantees. Failed\nwrites also lack a requirement to preserve previously saved data.\n\nExtend offline and persistence requirements to all local application\ndata, specify preservation on failure, and define the recruitment\nterms so stakeholders share a consistent interpretation.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":13,"deletions":7}}},{"hash":"71fd8ef95235dffbd17d32d04c3705838bebf3c7","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Clarify developer guide glossary terminology","messageBody":"The glossary includes ordinary phrases and ambiguous terms that can\nleave stakeholders with different interpretations. The guide title\nstill names AddressBook rather than RecruiterBuddy.\n\nKeep seven focused domain definitions, distinguish command shortcuts\nand candidate status history, and align the persistence terminology.\nExpand MSS at first use and rename the guide to match the product.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":10,"deletions":13}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"3e0aa7e05b2eeae5116afc546658f7eb82542df6","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #23 from wangyixuan818/17-add-about-us","messageBody":"Add Yixuan\u0027s AboutUs Description","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-04T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"4ab13c56d26241217f9950441a5e51d043ea34d4","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #31 from wangyixuan818/29-update-nfrs-glossary","messageBody":"Update NFRs and glossary in Developer Guide","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"a24cea53f6d84287809749d4e6150caf49e8085e","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #30 from wangyixuan818/28-update-site-wide-settings","messageBody":"Update site-wide settings and remove AB3 references","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"kpkavin04":[{"date":"2026-09-28T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"6f064c32808948c247a3d21b5e76c3cc965f04aa","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"AboutUs: Update Kavin\u0027s details","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":4,"deletions":6}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"cc528c44b61c9fd4f9b2cb086e0f8c656dbc9aac","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update RecruiterBuddy project overview","messageBody":"The project landing pages still describe the original AddressBook\nsample application.\n\nReplace the sample description with RecruiterBuddy\u0027s product purpose\nand planned MVP scope. This ensures that the pages reflect the\nselected product direction without presenting planned features as\nimplemented.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":53,"deletions":19}}},{"hash":"4a070ad581f84e95a20c390b61a204a1cc6c269d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Define RecruiterBuddy product scope","messageBody":"The Developer Guide still targets users managing generic contacts.\n\nDefine the department recruiter target profile and value proposition\nso that the requirements match RecruiterBuddy\u0027s product direction.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":13,"deletions":7}}},{"hash":"389fe4f1be1a40b3067477726e5e810d4ef85f94","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Revise RecruiterBuddy user stories","messageBody":"The existing user stories describe generic contact management and do\nnot capture the recruitment workflow.\n\nReplace them with prioritised RecruiterBuddy stories covering the MVP\nand optional future requirements.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":39,"deletions":10}}},{"hash":"1735ea53150beb12bc250ca8c672c622eb8fad12","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into update-kpkavin04-AboutUs","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"4d36d085e4b9559f9f96c6d40b2e9fb9d26a860a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AboutUs.md","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"b479a91163a9a69c727d3fb29f3f7d44ab7778e6","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #22 from kpkavin04/update-kpkavin04-AboutUs","messageBody":"21 AboutUs: Update Kavin\u0027s details","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"d3bdd7eb37de58e35879bee97bfeeabed3276431","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AboutUs.md","messageBody":"Corrected the naming of Samuel\u0027s image file within the img source.","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-04T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"8a09f219a2edc5174cbd1511d9d7ad2a03c42b6d","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into 36-update-product-documentation","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"aeb85daa9310853c948cba4fe650bee0decee096","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #37 from kpkavin04/36-update-product-documentation","messageBody":"Update product documentation","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-06T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"e4703899336281f3c3ca91066ccb84fbe8a06da5","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add persistent role model","messageBody":"RecruiterBuddy has no shared representation for role openings, which\nprevents role features from storing or observing role data.\n\nIntroduce validated immutable roles, unique role storage, JSON\npersistence, and observable model and logic access. This provides a\nstable foundation for adding and listing roles.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":620,"deletions":7},"test-code":{"insertions":590,"deletions":1}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-08T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"c4650b6ebd7ccea155784769ed42abb0246d2a74","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Derive role limits in constraint messages","messageBody":"Role validation messages repeat their length bounds as literals, which can\nleave user guidance inconsistent when a bound changes.\n\nDefine the bounds as constants and build each message from them. This keeps\nvalidation and guidance tied to one source of truth.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":11,"deletions":8}}},{"hash":"98450773d618bafdd6912684376170dd4d291d75","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #41 from kpkavin04/40-add-persistent-role-model","messageBody":"Add persistent role model","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"Monochromas":{"do